ull,"text":"袁宏道寫給朋友的信中說：「人的感情必須有所寄託，然後才能快樂。所以有人把下棋（弈）當作是心靈上的寄託，有人把聲色當作寄託，有人把鑽研技藝當作寄託，有人把寫作文章當作寄託。古代通達事理的人，能高出一般人一等，只是因為他們情感有所寄託，不肯敷衍虛度時光。」","n":126,"ssz":".................................................................................................2..2.....1..................."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items.label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（一）請依照故事脈絡，回答下列問題。","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items.answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"橘色（字元樣式 rStyle=aff6）；第 4 題另有橘色 roundRect 圈選","n":43,"ssz":"..........................................."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items.questions[0].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"斷句後的第一個分句，主語是誰？","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items.questions[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"袁宏道","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items.questions[1].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"承上題，這個主語怎麼樣或做什麼？","n":16,"ssz":".....1.........."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items.questions[1].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"與友人書/寫信給朋友","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items.questions[2].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「人情必有所寄，然後能樂」一句的主語是什麼？","n":22,"ssz":".............1........"},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items.questions[2].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"人情","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items.questions[3].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"承上題，這個主語做了什麼才「能樂」？","n":18,"ssz":".....1............"},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items.questions[3].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"寄信","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items.questions[3].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"有寄託","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items.questions[3].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"橘色 roundRect 圈住「有寄託」（全課唯一的圈選圖形），PDF p10 可見","n":42,"ssz":".........................................."},{"section":"s